><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KISHINO YOSHIYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook> </applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NIPPON KAYAKU KK</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OCHI HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SAKO KENJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI SEIGO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KISHINO, YOSHIYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NIPPON KAYAKU KABUSHIKI-KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OCHI, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAKO, KENJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI, SEIGO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KISHINO YOSHIYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OCHI HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SAKO KENJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI SEIGO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KISHINO, YOSHIYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OCHI, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAKO, KENJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI, SEIGO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A gas generator capable of performing the intended function of an air bag by controlling the air bag so that the air bag can be expandedly inflated slowly at the initial stage of the expansion and then expandedly inflated rapidly, wherein an enclosed space (S) in a housing (1) is divided into two combustion chambers (3, 4), gas generating agents (6), filter members (7), and ignitors (8, 9) are arranged in the combustion chambers (3, 4), respectively, and the combustion chambers (3, 4) are formed in communication with each other through the filter member (7), whereby, by operating the ignitors at a different timing between them, the air bag can be controlled in multiple stages in which the air bag is expandedly inflated slowly by a small amount of gas produced in one combustion chamber at the initial stage of the expansion of the air bag and then expandedly inflated rapidly by a large amount of gas produced in both combustion chambers.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un générateur de gaz capable de faire office d'air bag et de commander ce dernier, de sorte que cet air bag se gonfle en se déployant lentement au stade initial de son déploiement, avant de se gonfler par la suite plus rapidement. Un espace fermé (S) ménagé à l'intérieur d'un logement (1) est divisé en deux chambres de combustion (3, 4), des agents générateurs de gaz (6), des éléments filtres (7), et des allumeurs (8, 9) étant placés dans chacune de ces chambres de combustion (3, 4). Ces chambres de combustion (3, 4) sont conçues de manière à pouvoir communiquer l'une avec l'autre par l'intermédiaire dudit élément filtre (7). De plus, les allumeurs étant destinés à fonctionner en alternance, l'air bag peut être commandé à divers stades au cours desquels cet air bag se gonfle en se déployant lentement grâce à une faible quantité de gaz produite dans une chambre de combustion au stade initial de son déploiement, puis se déploie plus rapidement grâce à une grande quantité de gaz produite dans les deux chambres de combustion.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>